"lessons":"She follows through reliably on intensity 1 tasks and best around midday and afternoon, especially 12:00-14:00 with psychological capability or physical opportunity; evenings are also fine. Mornings are weaker, intensity 2 is less reliable, and outdoor context is weak. I put demanding tasks (cardio, long walk) in midday windows on weekdays, spread light planning tasks across days, and put alongside tasks at midday or habitual evening times."}
